  "strategy_explanation": "Map the real CME NDOG/NWOG to BTCUSDT or ETHUSDT, wait for two completed 15-minute bars, and let one five-feature ML model choose between two premarked ICT/SMC liquidity draws: the mapped prior CME close for rebalancing or the nearest previous-day/week external liquidity in the gap direction for accepted delivery. Enter next open only when structural expectancy after 18bp is positive; the unselected destination is the stop.",
  "summary": "One shared five-feature standardized L2 logistic competing-risk model trained on 56 causally resolved 2021 CME BTC/ETH opening-gap events and evaluated on untouched 2022. It routed 45 positive-EV setups, accepted 38 after one-global-slot arbitration and returned +18.2525%/+15.5962%/+12.9980% at 12/18/24bp. The model had 2022 event-label ROC AUC 0.7530, but the tradable path failed: median trade was negative at every cost, top-10%-positive-winner removal was negative, the five largest winners supplied about 78% of positive PnL, only Q3-Q4 were positive, and trade count was 38 versus the 40 gate. Development failed, 2023 and 2024-2026 stayed sealed, and the exact model is retired without adding features, models or thresholds.",
